        "tool": "describe_tables",
        "arguments": {
          "tables": [
            "users"
          ]
        },
        "ok": true,
        "output": "表 users\n  user_id INTEGER\n  register_date TEXT NOT NULL  -- 注册日期 YYYY-MM-DD\n  region_code TEXT NOT NULL\n  gender TEXT  -- M / F / NULL（未填写）\n  birth_year INTEGER\n  member_level TEXT NOT NULL  -- normal / silver / gold\n  acquire_channel TEXT NOT NULL  -- 拉新渠道：organic / ads / referral\n  is_test INTEGER NOT NULL  -- 1 表示内部测试账号，统计时必须排除\n  外键: region_code -> regions(region_code)\n  样例 (user_id | register_date | region_code | gender | birth_year | member_level | acquire_channel | is_test):\n  1 | 2024-04-17 | NORTH | F | 1975 | normal | ads | 0\n  2 | 2024-11-26 | NORTH | None | 1983 | silver | ads | 0\n  3 | 2025-12-03 | EAST | F | 1989 | silver | organic | 0",
        "duration_ms": 1,
        "thought": ""
